{"id":"590324","name":"韭菜盒子","author":"伊悠悠","authorId":"230225","desc":"","cover":"images/590324/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"韭菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"粉丝","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"猪油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"韭菜洗净。","img":"images/590324/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切碎，放适量盐，搅拌，放置20分钟。","img":"images/590324/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"粉丝泡温水。","img":"images/590324/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"挤干韭菜水，切碎粉丝。","img":"images/590324/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放融化的猪油，香油，适量盐，搅拌匀。","img":"images/590324/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"面粉一半放开水，用筷子搅成絮状，另一半放冷水，搅絮状。","img":"images/590324/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"揉成比较软的面团，盖好盖子，醒10分钟。","img":"images/590324/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"案板抹油，取适量面团，擀成大圆片。","img":"images/590324/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入韭菜粉丝馅，包成包子样。","img":"images/590324/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"按扁，用牙签插几个孔，再次按扁。","img":"images/590324/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"反面比较光滑。","img":"images/590324/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"电饼铛小火烘熟，锅里不需放油。","img":"images/590324/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"烘成两面面团有淡淡黄色。","img":"images/590324/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"盛盘即可。","img":"images/590324/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}